@startuml
title Safety net and judge contract: observations cross, authority does not
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction
rectangle "Untrusted data" #F6EBDC {
  component "Current message\naccepted history\npermitted shared documents" as data
  component "Buffered draft" as draft
}
rectangle "Deterministic safety net / same application process" #EDF7ED {
  component "Input rules\nsize, characters, secret patterns\nname and injection patterns" as ir
  component "Strict InputEvidence validation\ninput_decision()\nrisks -> scope -> name -> uncertainty\nvalidate specialist classification" as id
  component "Output rules\nsize, characters, secrets\nunsuitable greeting patterns" as outr
  component "Strict OutputEvidence validation\noutput_decision()\nsafety, name, scope, uncertainty, quality" as od
  component "Recheck owner; commit accepted exchange\nrelease exact inspected reply" as release
  component "Static refusal / neutral redirect\nor unavailable response\nno memory commit" as stop
}
rectangle "Judge boundary / advisory contract" #F3EAF6 {
  component "Fixed input rubric\nJSON data is not instructions\nrelevant=false for mixed/unrelated topics" as ij
  component "Fixed output rubric\ninspect current request and exact draft\nreject unrelated requests, even refusals" as oj
}
rectangle "Provider call boundary / client-side adapters" #FBE9E4 {
  component "LangChain model calls\njudge circuit: capacity, deadline\nslow-call discard, cooldown, one probe" as calls
  component "Generation circuit\none mixing or production agent\nfixed specialist rules + language" as generation
}
data --> ir
ir --> ij : rules passed
ij <--> calls : request / schema evidence
ij --> id : observations, never permissions
id --> generation : accepted + allowlisted specialist
generation --> draft
draft --> outr
outr --> oj : rules passed
oj <--> calls
oj --> od : observations, never permissions
od --> release : all mandatory gates passed
ir --> stop : reject
id --> stop : reject / uncertain / invalid
outr --> stop : reject
od --> stop : reject / uncertain / invalid
calls --> stop : timeout / failure / open circuit
generation --> stop : timeout / failure / open circuit
note bottom of id
Brief greetings/name setup may redirect to drinks.
Whiskey, wine, beer and Arak Sagi production are in scope.
Drink terms cannot authorize unrelated tasks or harmful assistance.
end note
note bottom of oj
A model can misclassify data or be manipulated.
Schema validity is not factual or safety assurance.
Live evaluations measure observed behavior separately.
end note
footer Agentic Drink Book | Policy 2.1.0 | Model judgments remain fallible
@enduml
